{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o004e","title":"立文昭皇后寝庙于邺","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o004e-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"立文昭皇后寝庙于邺","evidence":["mingdi-e-o004e-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-o021b-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"明帝即位后：本篇概述明帝即位后又别立寝庙，未在此条列出月份。","evidence":["houfei-e-o021b-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-p015b-account","label":"《魏书》三公奏","text":"是月：魏书载三公以姜嫄先例请先妣别立寝庙获准。","evidence":["houfei-e-p015b-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":227,"label":"二月辛巳","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y227","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o004","basis":"二月辛巳"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o004e-q","mingdi-q-o004","mingdi-q-o008","mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o004e-q","source_order":[3,31,"O004e"],"order":718}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o021b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-8b2d0d137a5b93189eba","layer":"original","quote":"又别立寝庙。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-p015b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-e7ae55c900177cab4d68","layer":"pei","quote":"是月，三公又奏曰：‘自古周人始祖后稷，又特立庙以祀姜嫄。今文昭皇后之于（万嗣）〔后嗣〕，圣德至化，岂有量哉！夫以皇家世（祀）〔妃〕之尊，而克让允恭，固推盛位；神灵迁化，而无寝庙以承享（礼）〔祀〕：非所以报显德，昭孝敬也。稽之古制，宜依《周礼》，先妣别立寝庙。’并奏，可之。","attribution":"《魏书》三公奏","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7572aa096216ab8c20bb","start":247,"end":383,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o004e-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o004","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
